    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42069" root="وطب" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طبة</span></b> , without teshdeed, [but whether <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَبُةٌ</span> or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِبَة</span> is meant is not said,] <i>A piece of skin,</i> or <i>hide:</i>
thought by ISd to be perhaps from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوَطْبُ</span>:
but the word commonly known is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طبّة</span>, with
teshdeed, mentioned in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طب</span>. (TA.)

